# Common-emitter NPN amplifier stage with a bias divider, collector and
# emitter resistors. Exercises the transistor symbol (three pins), vcc,
# an L-shaped base route and tapped output.
circuit Common-emitter amplifier

vcc 10 0
wire 4 0  16 0
dot 10 0

resistor  4  3  v  R1  47k
resistor  4  9  v  R2  10k
dot 4 6
wire 4 6  8 6  8 9  12 9
label 9 8.3 Vin

resistor 16  3  v  RC  2.2k
npn      15  9  h  Q1  BC547
dot 16 6
wire 16 6  19 6
label 19.5 6.3 Vout

resistor 16 15  v  RE  1k
wire 4 12  4 18  16 18
gnd 10 18
dot 10 18
